Value SLOT (\d+)
Value MODEL (\S+)
Value TEMP_NAME (\S+)
Value WARNING_TEMP (\d+)
Value SHUTDOWN_TEMP (\d+)
Value CURRENT_TEMP (\d+)
Value STATUS (ok|warning|alarm|\S+)

Start
  ^Slot\s+Card_type\s+Temp_name
  ^-+
  ^${SLOT}\s+${MODEL}\s+${TEMP_NAME}\s+${WARNING_TEMP}\s+${SHUTDOWN_TEMP}\s+${CURRENT_TEMP}\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
